---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import LegalPage from '../components/LegalPage.astro';
import { SOCIAL, SITE, PRICING } from '../consts';
---

<BaseLayout title="Terms" description={`The terms that apply to ${SITE.name} services.`}>
  <LegalPage title="Terms" updated="August 2026">
    <h2>Who you are dealing with</h2>
    <p>
      These terms apply to {SITE.name} LLC and to the services described on this
      site: consultations, private classes, and Circles.
    </p>

    <h2>What these services are — and are not</h2>
    <p>
      Consultations and private classes are consultation and education. They do
      not create a provider–patient relationship, they are not a substitute for
      care from your own clinician, and nothing said in them is a diagnosis or a
      prescription.
    </p>
    <p>
      A Circle is a group support and learning space, not therapy and not
      clinical care. If something is urgent, contact your own clinician or your
      local emergency number rather than waiting for a session.
    </p>

    <h2>Booking and payment</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>The introductory call is {PRICING.consultIntro.label.toLowerCase()}.</li>
      <li>An initial consultation is {PRICING.consultInitial.label}; a follow-up is {PRICING.consultFollowUp.label}.</li>
      <li>A private class is {PRICING.privateClass.label} {PRICING.privateClass.suffix}.</li>
      <li>
        A Circle is {PRICING.circle.label} for {PRICING.circle.weeks} weeks, or
        {PRICING.circle.instalments.count} monthly payments of
        {PRICING.circle.instalments.label}.
      </li>
    </ul>
    <p>
      Circles are sold through Podia, and Podia's own terms cover that purchase,
      the payment, and your access to the Circle. Consultations and classes are
      arranged directly.
    </p>

    <h2>Rescheduling and cancellation</h2>
    <p>
      Life with a small child does not run to a schedule, and the intention here
      is to be reasonable. Please give as much notice as you can if you need to
      move a session, and it will be moved.
    </p>

    <h2>Gifts</h2>
    <p>
      A gifted Circle is redeemable against any open Circle and does not expire.
      Fulfilment is handled personally — see <a href="/gift">the gift page</a>
      for how it works.
    </p>

    <h2>Recordings and materials</h2>
    <p>
      Slides, recordings, and other materials are for the person or family who
      booked, and are not for redistribution. Circle recordings and files stay
      available to members through Podia after the cohort has finished.
    </p>

    <h2>Confidentiality in a group</h2>
    <p>
      A Circle only works because people speak honestly. What is shared in a
      Circle stays in that Circle.
    </p>

    <h2>Contact</h2>
    <p>
      Anything unclear here can be raised at{' '}
      <a href={`mailto:${SOCIAL.email}`}>{SOCIAL.email}</a> before you book.
    </p>
  </LegalPage>
</BaseLayout>
